From 1717171717171717171717171717171717171717 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] soc: mediatek: regulator-coupler: Add MT6789 support

Enable the MediaTek regulator coupler on MT6789 platforms so that
coupled GPU<->SRAM regulators can balance voltages without falling
back to the generic coupler (which rejects non-always-on regulators).

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-regulator-coupler.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-regulator-coupler.c b/drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-regulator-coupler.c
index 1109e3d9a..7dee80baf 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-regulator-coupler.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-regulator-coupler.c
@@ -145,7 +145,8 @@ static struct mediatek_regulator_coupler mediatek_coupler = {
 
 static int mediatek_regulator_coupler_init(void)
 {
-	if (!of_machine_is_compatible("mediatek,mt8183") &&
+	if (!of_machine_is_compatible("mediatek,mt6789") &&
+	    !of_machine_is_compatible("mediatek,mt8183") &&
 	    !of_machine_is_compatible("mediatek,mt8186") &&
 	    !of_machine_is_compatible("mediatek,mt8188") &&
 	    !of_machine_is_compatible("mediatek,mt8189") &&
-- 
2.43.0
